  "question": {
    "text": "Let<br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>S</mi><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"}\" open=\"{\"><mrow><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>:</mo><msub><mi>log</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mfenced><mrow><msup><mn>9</mn><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>13</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>-</mo><msub><mi>log</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mfenced><mrow><mfrac><mn>5</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>&#183;</mo><msup><mn>3</mn><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>.</mo></math>&nbsp;Then the maximum value of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>&#946;</mi></math> for which the equation <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><msup><mfenced><mrow><munder><mo>&#8721;</mo><mrow><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>&#8712;</mo><mi>s</mi></mrow></munder><mi>&#945;</mi></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mo>+</mo><munder><mo>&#8721;</mo><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo>&#8712;</mo><mi>s</mi></mrow></munder><msup><mfenced><mrow><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>&#946;</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math>&nbsp;has real roots, is _____ ."
  },
  "options": [],
  "correct_answer": "25",
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Given,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>log</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mfenced><mrow><msup><mn>9</mn><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>13</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>-</mo><msub><mi>log</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mfenced><mrow><msup><mn>3</mn><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></msup><mo>&#183;</mo><mfrac><mn>5</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn></math></p><p>Now let&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mn>3</mn><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><mi>t</mi></math>, so the equation becomes,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>log</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mfenced><mrow><msup><mi>t</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>13</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>-</mo><msub><mi>log</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mfenced><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mn>5</mn><mi>t</mi></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><msub><mi>log</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mfrac><mfenced><mrow><msup><mi>t</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>13</mn></mrow></mfenced><mfenced><mrow><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\"><mfrac><mrow><mn>5</mn><mi>t</mi></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mstyle><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfrac><mfenced><mrow><msup><mi>t</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>13</mn></mrow></mfenced><mfenced><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\"><mfrac><mrow><mn>5</mn><mi>t</mi></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mstyle></mfenced></mfrac><mo>=</mo><msup><mn>2</mn><mn>2</mn></msup></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><msup><mi>t</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>13</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>10</mn><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><msup><mi>t</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>10</mn><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>9</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>t</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mtext>or</mtext><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>9</mn></math></p><p>So,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mn>3</mn><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mtext>or</mtext><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>9</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><msup><mn>3</mn><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><msup><mn>3</mn><mn>0</mn></msup><mo>&#160;</mo><mtext>or</mtext><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mn>3</mn><mn>2</mn></msup></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>or</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>2</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>3</mn></math></p><p>Now,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><msup><mfenced><mrow><munder><mo>&#8721;</mo><mrow><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>&#8712;</mo><mi>s</mi></mrow></munder><mi>&#945;</mi></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mo>+</mo><munder><mo>&#8721;</mo><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo>&#8712;</mo><mi>s</mi></mrow></munder><msup><mfenced><mrow><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>&#946;</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mfenced><mrow><msup><mfenced><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mfenced><mrow><msup><mn>3</mn><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mn>4</mn><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfenced><mi>&#946;</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>50</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>25</mn><mi>&#946;</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p>Now for real roots&nbsp;</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>D</mi><mo>&#8805;</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><msup><mn>50</mn><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>25</mn><mi>&#946;</mi><mo>&#8805;</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mn>50</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>&#946;</mi><mo>&#8805;</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>&#946;</mi><mo>&#8804;</mo><mn>25</mn></math></p><p>So, maximum value of&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>&#946;</mi></math>&nbsp;is&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>25</mn></math>.</p>"
  }
